<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="theme-color" content="#FFFFF3" />
		<meta name="description" content="O.Z. Radio Bali — coming soon." />
		<title>O.Z. Bali — O.Z. Radio</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<main class="bali-page">
			<header class="topbar">
				<a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="O.Z. Radio home">O<span>.</span>Z.</a>
				<a class="back-link" href="/">← ALL LOCATIONS</a>
				<span class="location-tag">LOCATION 02 · BALI</span>
			</header>
			<section class="message">
				<p class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> THE ISLAND FREQUENCY</p>
				<h1>O.Z. Bali<span>.</span></h1>
				<p>Something good is tuning in.<br />Check back soon.</p>
				<a class="back-button" href="/">← BACK TO LOCATIONS</a>
			</section>
			<footer class="footer"><span>GOOD MUSIC TRAVELS.</span><span>BALI · INDONESIA</span></footer>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	:global(*) {
		box-sizing: border-box;
	}

	:global(body) {
		margin: 0;
		background: #FFFFF3;
		color: #000000;
		font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
	}

	:global(a) {
		color: inherit;
	}

	.bali-page {
		min-height: 100svh;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		padding: 26px clamp(20px, 5vw, 64px) 20px;
	}

	.topbar,
	.footer {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 20px;
	}

	.wordmark {
		font-size: 25px;
		font-weight: 900;
		letter-spacing: -0.09em;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.wordmark span,
	h1 span {
		color: #F2BD57;
	}

	.back-link,
	.location-tag,
	.footer {
		color: #77776F;
		font-size: 9px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.message {
		margin: auto;
		padding: 90px 0;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 9px;
		margin: 0 0 22px;
		color: #77776F;
		font-size: 9px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.16em;
	}

	.live-dot {
		width: 7px;
		height: 7px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: #F2BD57;
	}

	h1 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(54px, 10vw, 96px);
		font-weight: 800;
		letter-spacing: -0.085em;
		line-height: 1;
	}

	.message > p:not(.eyebrow) {
		margin: 20px 0 28px;
		color: #77776F;
		font-size: 14px;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	.back-button {
		display: inline-block;
		padding: 14px 18px;
		border: 1px solid #D8D8CC;
		border-radius: 2px;
		font-size: 9px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: background 180ms ease, color 180ms ease;
	}

	.back-button:hover {
		background: #000000;
		color: #FFFFF3;
	}

	.footer {
		padding-top: 16px;
		border-top: 1px solid #D8D8CC;
	}
</style>
